window.products.push({"id":389047,"name":"COSTWAY 6-in-1 Stick Vacuum Cleaner, 16KPa Powerful Suction 600W Lightweight Corded Upright Vacuum Cleaner with HEPA Filtration, Cord Rewind and Comfo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71puMA2Q5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【16Kpa Strong but Quiet Suction】The 600W high-power and low-noise motor provides a powerful 16kpa suction, which enables the vacuum cleaner to quickly remove deep dirt. It can easily suck away pet hair, dust, debris and large particles. It is ideal for cleaning hardwood floors, tiles and marbles. 【2-layer Efficient Filtration System】The first filtration uses cyclonic vacuum technology to filter out 99.99% of the dust to achieve a continuous and efficient vacuuming effect. The second layer then uses a HEPA filtration system that intercepts 0.3 micron particles and expels cleaner air. 【6-in-1 Multifunctional Design】The lightweight design allows you to operate it with one hand and quickly convert it to a handheld vacuum cleaner to keep your entire home and car clean. And it includes a floor brush, a crevice nozzle and a 2-in-1 brush, so it has 6 ways to clean the floor, sofas, desks and ceiling. 【Humanized Detail Design】Powerful vacuum cleaner has a swivel steering that can be rotated at a large angle to clear hard-to-reach areas. Large-capacity dust cup and filter can be washed with water and reused for many times. Equipped with a tool organizer can effectively prevent the loss of accessories. And it has passed UL and ETL certification for safer use. 【Easy to Use and Store】This stick vacuum cleaner with easy-to-operate button and non-slip handle make your cleaning process easier and more comfortable. The lightweight design makes it easy to carry. The winding chute device facilitates the storage of the power cord. And it can be placed upright to reduce floor space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71puMA2Q5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B083W8BRDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083W8BRDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083W8BRDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
