window.products.push({"id":389060,"name":"Kate and Laurel Bess Farmhouse 3 Tier Tray, 16 x 12 x 26, Natural Wood and Black, Decorative Multi-Tiered Tray for Storage and Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h8sBMXEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the ultimate rustic centerpiece with the Bess wooden tray. Inspired by farmhouse design, this three-tiered tray has a colonial-inspired turned base with four beveled tray surfaces to prevent items from falling off. The Bess collection is handcrafted in India, making each piece distinct in woodgrain and finish. The entire tray is crafted from 100% authentic mango wood, making it look and feel high quality. The overall dimensions of this 3-tier tray are 16 inches wide by 12 inches deep by 26 inches tall to create an eye-catching statement piece for any surface. Each tray tier also has its distinct size: the top tray is 12 inches wide by 8 inches deep, the middle level is 14 inches wide by 10 inches deep, and the bottom shelf is 16 inches wide by 12 inches deep. These individual tray sizes are ripe for creativity, providing the space for a cascading display of desserts, unique succulent collections, or storage for makeup and jewelry. Thanks to a no-tools assembly process, the Bess is ready to dazzle with its farmhouse style in a matter of minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h8sBMXEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B09M2FXBDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M2FXBDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M2FXBDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389061,"name":"Heated Blanket, Large Electric Blanket Twin Size 62\"x84\" Flannel & Beige Cotton Wool, Extremely Soft and Comfortable Heating Blanket with 4 Heating Le","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zcQxbpgaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Flannel & Cotton Wool】Lisheth heated blanket is made of 200gsm friendly skin & good heat retention flannel + 200gsm fine texture & breathable cotton wool. The fabric is softer, thicker than normal blankets, and warmer than normal blankets even without electricity. The electric blanket is Inner quilting process with double layer non-woven fabric to fixed heating wire, so it hardly to feel the heating wire, make you more comfortable and warm in cold winter days 【4 Temperature Settings & 10 Hours Auto-off】Lisheth electric blanket provides 4 heat settings, you can choose the most suitable setting for your body temperature. It also has 10 Hours Auto-off, which is more safe for using. There is no need to worry about forgetting to turn off after you fall asleep. It can provide you with maximum safety protection, save electricity and worry-free. 【Rapid Heating & Safety Protection】Using PTC and NTC heating technology, the electric blanket can be heated in a few seconds, and the heating is more evenly; the protection system with dual certification of ETL and FCC prevents overheating and ensures that you and your family safe, eliminate potential safety hazards. It is also a great gift for parents, grandparents, lovers, friends, birthdays and Christmas. 【Warm Keeping & Money Saving】Using Lisheth 120w heating blanket while turning off your thermostat can save 60-85% a year on your heating bill (based on the size of your electric heated blanket). Compared with air conditioner or space heater, using heated throw is more energy efficient, This is the best way to save money in winter. Get warm, get cozy with Lisheth heated throw blanket. 【Versatile and Multi-purpose】The 62 * 84 inches measurements allows you and your loved ones get enough warmth together in bed or snuggle on the couch. The scope of wrapping the body and using area are expanded; You can detach the controller when the weather is hot to use as a normal blanket. 【After-sale Service】Please read the Instructions Manual carefully before using. There is a slight color difference between the object and the picture. If you have any quality-related issues, please feel free to contact us immediately. We will provide a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zcQxbpgaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L Lisheth","source_asin":"B0C3C8VPGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3C8VPGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3C8VPGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
