window.products.push({"id":389082,"name":"True & Tidy, Steam Hand Held Steamer with Stainless Steel Nozzle, Includes Fabric Brush and Water Cup, TS-20, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOVe5QhcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our True & Tidy steam hand held steamer is perfect for clothes, drapes, upholstery and more and will smooth even the most stubborn wrinkles!Included AttachmentsIncludes an attachable fabric brush which easily and securely attaches to the nozzle of the hand steamer. The fabric brush is constructed of strong, durable bristles which safely and effectively removes pet hair, lint and dust from your fabrics and allows steam to better penetrate your fabric.Also includes a measuring cup that allows you to conveniently fill the water tank.Ease and ConvenienceThis unit is compact and easy to store due to its lightweight, handheld design.The power cord allows you to step away from the wall and comfortably reach and maneuver around your garment.This handheld steam iron has a 90 degree safety handle lock for more security, and and ergonomic handle with an easy to use on/off power switch.The large 135 ml ribbed water tank has a larger opening for easier water filling.VersatileSteam is the gentlest and most effective way to release wrinkles.The portable steam iron is safe to use on most fabrics including cotton, linen, silk, rayon, polyester, lace and more.Compact and PowerfulThe True & Tidy handheld steamer is just over 1 pound and 8.5 inches tall, making it perfect for home, office or travel. With steam reaching temperatures in just 90 seconds you will be able to quickly and easily straighten wrinkles caused by packing. This handheld steamer for clothes provides a powerful 600 watts of continuous steam for 10 minutes with a full tank.True & Tidy products are sold in fine retailers throughout North America. True & Tidy offers modern, innovative home products at great prices. Our goal is to beautify your home and life with colorful & functional home products.True & Tidy is owned and distributed by Capital Technology, Inc. with corporate offices in Chino, California, USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOVe5QhcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"True & Tidy","source_asin":"B09FCSZHL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FCSZHL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FCSZHL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
