window.products.push({"id":389106,"name":"Orchids Artificial Flowers 14\" Large Fake Orchid White Phalaenopsis Orchid Flower Arrangements with Ceramic Vase Faux Orchid for Home Bathroom Table C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711TeJUk-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Realistic-looking Appearance & Real Touch --- With a soft texture, the faux orchid flowers have some fake moss and fake eucalyptus plants in the pot, which makes them look more realistic and have a breath of life. The orchid comes lined with faux flowers in a sleek purple color, and its stems, leaves, and buds boast the slightly shiny, sturdy appearance you’d expect from the real thing. Versatile in Design & Decor --- The artificial orchids come with a white ceramic pot, which is perfect in size and will fit great in your office, living room, kitchen, or bathroom. And it is also the ideal gift for a coworker who is starting a new job or for a friend’s housewarming party. Low Maintenance & No Seasonal Variations --- The phalaenopsis orchid flowers require no regular care and maintenance. They will stay intact and will look great with less attention throughout the year, no flowers will fall off from the faux plants. Allergy sufferers will be thankful because they will never be allergic to fake flowers. Safety & Premium Material --- Made with high-quality PU and plastic, the artificial orchid flowers are safe for your child and pets. Durable and flexible material allows for easy bending and re-shaping. Adorn Your Home with Briful Orchids Artificial Flowers --- The white orchid artificial flowers stand 13.4 inches tall. The pot is 3.9 inches high with a sturdy 8.6-inch diameter base. Founded in 1995, Briful has years of experience designing, developing, and manufacturing high-quality indoor and outdoor decorative artificial plants & flowers, gift boxes, candles, etc. Welcome to our store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711TeJUk-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Briful","source_asin":"B0B82CFJPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82CFJPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82CFJPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
