window.products.push({"id":389109,"name":"SAISN Mesh Portable Shower Caddy with 7+1 Pocket Bath Organizer Bag Quick Dry Shower Tote Bag Oxford Hanging Toiletry and Bath Accessories for Dorm Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718fvai-96L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"EASY TO CARRY - This shower tote bag is compact and lightweight makes carrying anywhere easy. Perfect for college dorm, travel, gym,traveling, camping or simply hanging up to maximize valuable shower space and a quick overnight. Cute - Unique print design handle make it looks different. DESIGNED FOR CONVENIENCE - size 8\" * 8\" with 1 large center pocket and 7 side pockets of varying sizes to allow you to neatly store all your need beauty and bathing essentials easy and convenient. It is also equipped with one sturdy reinforced handles which can be used to hang the tote on pegs or safely store your keys. BREATHABLE MESH FABRIC - Made from Pvc Mesh and you can easily wash it in the washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718fvai-96L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAISN","source_asin":"B07D3JWPZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3JWPZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3JWPZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389110,"name":"Milliard 2in. Egg Crate Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper - Twin, Mattress Pad Provides Great Pressure Relief, Gel Infusion Contributes to a Cooler Nigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mVbjhVTSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Comfort For Less Premium orthopedic-grade memory foam mattresses are prohibitively expensive and may leave you considering a sacrifice to comfort, but there’s no need to toss away your old mattress just yet! Milliard Gel Infused Memory Foam Toppers lay on top of any type of mattress to add supple texture and support for a premium level of comfort without the compromise to your wallet. Top That With Egg Crate!! The topper acts like a mini-mattress to achieve the body-contouring properties of typical memory foam mattresses, but uses your existing mattress for support – similar to premium pillow-top mattresses. The “egg crate” texture gently compresses under heavy points of contact between your body and the foam to provide additional support, and lifts areas of lesser contact to naturally restore your posture. Through minimizing the points of contact made with the bed, \"egg crate\" can help improve circulation and reduce bed sores. Chill Out Memory foam is supple and supportive, but it’s also an effective insulator. This may not be such a problem during colder months, but you may not appreciate it when the temperature rises, so we’ve perforated our memory foam with specifically patterned aeration channels to circulate cool air around you with the warmer air generated by your body. We’ve also infused the memory foam with endothermic cooling gel to conduct excess heat away from your body so you can be cool while the foam is under pressure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mVbjhVTSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milliard","source_asin":"B07CZPF8C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZPF8C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZPF8C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389111,"name":"Trifo Lucy Robot Vacuum Cleaner 3000Pa, Home Surveillance Visual Smart Mapping Automatic Robotic Vacuums, TIRVS AI Obstacle Avoidance, Alexa/App Contr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C8fjhs36L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【The Most Intelligent Vision】Built-in intelligent TIRVS 3.0 tech provides smart vision, for object recognition, room/intruder awareness and self-mapping functions. With TIRVS, Lucy gets smarter with each clean and decides the best cleaning path. TIRVS recognizes over 70 different household items and can see objects down to 1” to avoid cords and even pet accidents. 【More Than Cleaning】With dual 1080P HDR and depth cameras and advanced ToF sensors, Lucy provides motion presense alerts and recording even in the dark making Lucy a round-the-clock mobile security system. Built-in two-way audio allows you to interact with your pet anytime. AI, advanced camera technology and an easy-to-use app together make Lucy more than a vacuum. 【Professional-grade Cleaning】Lucy has a powerful but quiet 3000Pa suction power that can easily pick up dirt, pet hair and more from all floor types. Automatically detects carpets to increase suction for a deep, professional clean. 【Thinner Body】Lucy adopts dual cameras that simulate the human eyes for real-time navigation. Compared to robots with raised lidar devices, Lucy achieves a thinner body and can detect obstacles down to 1”, while lidar vacuum cleaners can only detect obstacles 4” or higher, which means Lucy can clean lower couch and has a smarter obstacle avoidance strategy. 【APP & Voice Control】Lucy supports market-leading 2.4/5GHz WiFi to connect to the APP, and 5GHz WiFi can provide a more stable connection. Trifo’s easy to use APP allows you to adjust suction, no-go zone, virtual walls and more. Lucy with smart home devices such as Alexa and Google Home for a truly hands-free experience. 【Marathon Cleaner】Lucy adopts LG's 5200mAh battery with a maximum battery life of 120 minutes to satisfy your battery life anxiety. The 600ML large dust box is enough for you to use for a week without cleaning. 【Warranty Service】Trifo values every customer's experience, we provide 12 months warranty and lifetime technical guidance support. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C8fjhs36L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trifo","source_asin":"B0BB68MDZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB68MDZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB68MDZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389112,"name":"Mkono Fake Plants in Ceramic Pot, 11\" Potted Artificial Plants for Home Decor Indoor Faux Green Leaf Plant with Modern White Planter for Desk Shelf Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hMBgK-U7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need to Assemble : Faux potted plant comes in separate parts, you need to assemble them into a finished product. Just stick the artificial plant into the middle hole of the sponge in the pot, sprinkle the decorative stones and arrange the pothos leaves manually because it is shipping folded. Lifelike and Easy to Care : Made of high quality plastic, the fake plant looks realistic to the eye and remains just as fresh-looking and beautiful year after year. Great way to add modern decorative touch and some natural greenery to your living space without worry of overwatering and underwatering. Dimension: The ceramic plant pot is 4\" in diameter and 3.3\" in height. The artificial potted plant measures appr. 11\" tall from the bottom of the pot to the top of the plant and 9\" to 9.8\" wide from tip to tip of the leaves. Note: If the leaves fall off, you can stick them back into the stem due to the leaves and stems are detachable. Extensive Decor : Fake potted plant can be an elegant addition to wedding, housewarming and party decor, centerpieces, bookshelf, desk, counter, shop, kitchen, bedroom, living room, bathroom, office, home or any other places you want to add vitality. Perfect Gift for who are not good with live plants but want to easily enjoy the beauty of nature! Package Included : 1 x artificial pothos plant, 1 x ceramic pot, 1 x pearl wool, 1 bag x sand, and 1 bag x little white stone. Note: Real plants are not included in this set. Mkono is a registered trademark and our product is professional manufacturing and sole selling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hMBgK-U7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mkono","source_asin":"B08DG3SHFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DG3SHFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DG3SHFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
