window.products.push({"id":389150,"name":"FiveSeasonStuff Iris Flower | Flowers Artificial for Decoration | Wedding Bridal Home Kitchen Party Décor | 6 Real Touch Long Stems (23.6’’) | Real Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NOt02E-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The name iris comes from the Greek goddess of the rainbow. One of the peculiarities of iris flowers are the flowers and leaves. Enjoy these hydrangeas all year round. Material of flowers are made of PU (polyurethane) and stems are made of plastic and metal wire. Notes: When silk flowers arrive, unbend the stems and arrange the irises for some room to breathe, slightly puff the petals and rearrange the stems to desired effect. Keep out of sunlight, color will fade over time. If placed outside, use as flower for grave or for cemetery flower vase as an example, exposure to sun and external elements like rain, snow and hot and cold temperatures will likely, in the long run affect the color to fade over time which is a normal process as for most artificial plants or fake plants. Notes: The color of fake iris flowers may vary due to differences in monitor displays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NOt02E-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FiveSeasonStuff","source_asin":"B07SNB9HL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SNB9HL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SNB9HL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
