window.products.push({"id":389211,"name":"Awesims Home Decor Flower Pillow, Decorative Pillows, Super Soft 15.7\" Cute Pillows, Floor Pillows Seating for Children, Flower Throw Pillow Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g8vQGTacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌼 {Cute Pillow for Kids and Adults} Brighten up any room with a decorative flower pillow for your couch, cushion, or bed. Our floor cushions add happy vibes to any room. The vibrant colors and soft texture make you feel like you're lying on a flower bed! Let these preppy pillows make you smile everyday. 🌼 {Sized Just Right} These decorative throw pillows measure 15.7\". They're great accent pieces for small spaces - think of the aesthetic pillows as nice decorative accents on a young girl’s bed or a chair pillow for a study desk. These cute throw pillows are just the right size to be huggable! 🌼 {Premium Plush and Fabric} We mentioned that our flower plush pillow is huggable - that's because the flower cushion is stuffed with premium material, encased with ultra-soft covering made from fine and delicate fabric. This flower shaped pillow adds character and comfort no matter where you put it! 🌼 {Happy Room Accessory} Our flower shaped throw pillow works anywhere! Put the daisy pillow on the bed, or put the pillow flower in a dorm room for a bit of cheer. Place the floor plush pillow in your daughter's room for a touch of feminine charm. The colorful flower pillow amps up the vibe in any space. 🌼 {For Your Sweetheart} Who wouldn't love a sweet and colorful flower pillow to brighten up the room? Our floor pillow is a sweet birthday gift for girls. Or give them as cute gifts for girlfriends. They're great gifts for car lovers too offering lumbar support for driving or extra comfort while riding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g8vQGTacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AweSims Home Décor","source_asin":"B0C28R6GVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C28R6GVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C28R6GVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389212,"name":"India Watercolor Map by Michael Tompsett, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MuQ61gA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor map of India. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MuQ61gA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGQN68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGQN68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGQN68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
