window.products.push({"id":389241,"name":"EngooBoly 23.6\"(60CM) Big Long Sandalwood Incense Sticks Burns for Approx 12hours 15 Pack for The Spring Festival","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N7MNge3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Combustible bouquets were used by the ancient Egyptians, who employed incense in both pragmatic and mystical capacities. Incense was burnt to counteract or obscure malodorous products of human habitation but was widely perceived to also deter malevolent demons and appease the gods with its pleasant aroma. Incense burners have been found in the Indus Civilization (3300–1300 BCE). Evidence suggests oils were used mainly for their aroma. India also adopted techniques from East Asia, adapting the formulation to encompass aromatic roots and other indigenous flora. This was the first usage of subterranean plant parts in incense. New herbs like Sarsaparilla seeds, frankincense, and cypress were used by Indians. At around 2000 BCE, Ancient China began the use of incense in the religious sense, namely for worship.Incense was used by Chinese cultures from Neolithic times and became more widespread in the Xia, Shang, and Zhou dynasties. The earliest documented use of incense comes from the ancient Chinese, who employed incense composed of herbs and plant products (such as cassia, cinnamon, styrax, and sandalwood) as a component of numerous formalized ceremonial rites. Incense usage reached its peak during the Song dynasty with numerous buildings erected specifically for incense ceremonies. Brought to Japan in the 6th century by Korean Buddhist monks, who used the mystical aromas in their purification rites, the delicate scents of Koh (high-quality Japanese incense) became a source of amusement and entertainment with nobles in the Imperial Court during the Heian Era 200 years later. During the 14th-century Ashikaga shogunate, a samurai warrior might perfume his helmet and armor with incense to achieve an aura of invincibility (as well as to make a noble gesture to whoever might take his head in battle). It wasn't until the Muromachi period during the 15th and 16th century that incense appreciation (kōdō) spread to the upper and middle classes of Japanese society.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N7MNge3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EngooBoly","source_asin":"B081Q4XD52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081Q4XD52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081Q4XD52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389242,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Roller Shade Heat Insulation Hardwired Smart Blinds Voice Control Alexa Roller Blinds with Valance (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NpTccabvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: 100% BLACKOUT & HEAT INSULATION. You can keep privacy when motorized blinds fully unfold. Heat insulation material can reduce heat loss of your room. It can make your room cooler in summer and warmer on winter. Smart Hardwired Motor: Work under 100V-220V, with 71inches wire, need to be plug-in all the time. Please make sure there is a socket near the window.can realize mobile devices control, voice control, timing control and group control. D60137 & D60135 are suitable for 2.4G Wifi signal and D60136 remote. D60137 can be controlled by mobile and Alexa / Google home. D60135 is designed for Apple users and can be controlled by Apple mobile devices and Homepod. LEAD TIME: dispatch in 3-5 working days after getting size confirmation, 5-8 working days for transportation. Each motorized window shade with remote is made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measures & careful orders, avoid return without quality issues. Please buy a fabric sample first if you are not sure which color to choose. Please contact us for a refund of the fabric samples if you place an order for Yoolax power blind. MADE-TO-ORDER: Motorized Blackout Window Shades is custom made, you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the top right. Then please follow the guide to place the order. We will send an email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please attention to the email the day after your order. And other special sizes you can contact us via Amazon message. SERVICE: Easy install, all mounting kits, instructions are included in the package. The remote be basically programmed before ship. Yoolax offers a 2-year warranty on motors and controls. Any damage or failure of motors or controls happens in the first 2 years, we provide repair or replacement free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NpTccabvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B081VDT9WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VDT9WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VDT9WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
