window.products.push({"id":389270,"name":"16 Colors Fairy Lights, 2 Packs String Lights 16.4 Ft 50 LEDs with Remote, Battery & USB Powered DIY Twinkle Lights with Timer, Christmas Lighting for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aZlI+LaMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Battery & USB Operated】This is battery operated string light, but also USB string light, dual power supply options. The micro-USB design on the battery box makes it possible to power your lights with either batteries or a USB. Use 3 AA batteries when there's no outlet. Simply connect to a USB socket or power bank to light it up if no batteries available. 【Upgraded 4-Wires】The led fairy light contains 4 wires, which is more durable than the normal 2-wire lights, feel free to shape it as you want and the wire will not get broken easily. There are 16 lighting colors and 4 flashing modes(strobe, fade, flash, smooth), with which you can create much more themes & scenarios for your bedroom, Christmas tree, balcony, garden, party, wedding, celebrations, etc. 【Remote Control with Timer】Each pack of our wire string lights comes with remote, you can easily turn on/off the lights, change the colors, flashing modes, and set the timer. The remote control adopts Infrared technology, which allows you to control it 16-26ft far away. You can just stay indoors and control your fairy string lights placed in your garden or other places!(please aim at the light string to ensure that the remote control can work properly when using the remote) 【IP65 Waterproof & Decorative Wire Lights】These battery operated led fairy lights are waterproof except for the USB interface , so you can feel free to use it outdoors without worrying about the rain. Each pack is 16.4ft long, which make sure the wire is long enough to wrap around your trees, decorating your gazebo, patios and etc. It’s gonna take on bright and colorful effects absolutely. 【Wide Applications】These waterproof copper wires make it perfect for outdoor decorations, the lights are light-weight and easy to install, which make it suitable for garden, camping, balcony, outdoor party, Halloween, Christmas tree, etc. Gonna create a festive, lovely, soft or romantic atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aZlI+LaMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLODD","source_asin":"B08R74QF3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R74QF3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R74QF3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
