window.products.push({"id":389299,"name":"Safe and Sound King Waterproof Mattress Protector, Breathable Soft Cotton Terry Surface Bed Protector, Noiseless Deep Pocket Fitted Up 8 Inch-21 Inch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NLaTuYNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF PROTECTION - King size mattress protector has an impermeable waterproof TPU backing on the bottom. The premium TPU has a superior waterproof function and will not cause plastic sounds. It will protect your mattress from urine, sweat, spilled drink, or any liquid accident, and also dirt and stains. COMFORTABLE & BREATHABLE - Our king bed protector is made of high-quality cotton terry fabric. The top surface allows heat or air to pass through, ensuring maximum softness and freshness. This mattress protector king size will not change the feel of your mattress and offer a valuable night’s sleep. FITTED SHEET STYLE - King size mattress cover (78\"x80\"). The deep pocket design fits most types of mattresses up 8-21 inches in depth. The durable and highly elastic skirt will wrap your mattress tightly and keep it in place. The mattress protector can protect the top and side of your mattress all night. HARMLESS MATERIAL - Our king protector waterproof cover has OEKO-TEX certification. It means we use only materials that do not contain any vinyl, BPA, phthalates, and other harmful chemicals. We provide ultimate mattress protection and a king size protector is designed to protect you and your mattress. EASY TO CLEAN: Machine washable and dryer friendly. Wash with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low to extend product service life. Do not iron, do not bleach. It can be used in homes, hotels, hospitals, dorms, etc. We offer a 90-day full refund with no questions asked and 24-hour customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NLaTuYNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safe and Sound","source_asin":"B089SKGFYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089SKGFYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089SKGFYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
