window.products.push({"id":389303,"name":"Cottage Garden Music Box - 10Th Anniversary Plays \"Unchained Melody\" With Ornate Champaign Silver Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4n1SxELL._AC_SL1163_.jpg","description":"Cottage Garden inspirational and sentimental products are both lovely and classic in style. Be encouraged by a message that reads, \"Tenth anniversary. Celebrate the joy of your love.\" Designed by artists in the Heartland of America, Cottage Garden’s Collections reach a variety of tastes and have a wide range of occasions for gifting. Ornate border with silvertone finish and sweet sentiment art gives this music box timeless appeal. Jewelry box measures approximately 8 x 6 x 2.75 inches; Replace artwork with 5 x 3 inch personal photo. Traditional wind-up mechanism engages music to play melodic tune Unchained Melody. Black velvet lined interior cushions your precious treasures; Decorative bun feet are padded to protect table top and shelf surfaces. Ships in protective packaging; Ready for giving to that special someone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4n1SxELL._AC_SL1163_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottage Garden","source_asin":"B0065OG4AK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0065OG4AK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0065OG4AK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389304,"name":"DOX + LAMB 7PC Variety White Sage Kit, Beginner Smudging Bundle, Lavender, Chakra, Rose Flower Sage, Rosemary, Dragon Blood, Palo Santo. Meditation, N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ULQqtYwaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dox + Lamb, where our slogan is “Good Vibes|Good Life”. We believe our thoughts create our reality and play a key role in allowing us to live our best lives. When we create a positive mindset with positive statements, happiness is inspired and transpires through our daily life and bodies. Our sage smudge kits make beautiful gifts for anyone in the healing arts, Reiki, Yoga, Meditation, tarot card readers, psychics, Valentines gifts, Mothers Day Gifts, for teachers, gifts for friends, travelers, and makes a great spiritual gift. Makes a great housewarming present and travel accessory as well to clean homes and rooms energies of any past occupants. HOW TO USE: Hold White Sage Smudge Sticks and Palo Santo sticks at a 45 degree angle and ignite. Let the stick burn for a few seconds. When the fire is mostly out, wave the smoke around your home with a feather or your hand with positive intentions, and peaceful and positive thoughts to clean the bad energy. Make sure the smoke reaches all the areas of your home that you want to cleanse, including dark closets and corners. Use an abalone shell or ceramic dish filled with sand to catch the ashes. When finished extinguish smudging sticks fully","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ULQqtYwaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dox + Lamb","source_asin":"B08W29JMDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W29JMDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W29JMDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389305,"name":"Flash Furniture Avery 2 Pack Contemporary White Vinyl Adjustable Height Barstool with Panel Back and Chrome Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919VCLlAVRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relax and hang out in this adjustable height, panel back white barstool that proves simple doesn't have to be boring. This piece would be a great fit for your home bar, game room or kitchen island. The seat and back are padded with 2\" of foam and upholstered in luxurious black vinyl. The swivel seat easily adjusts from counter to bar height using the convenient gas lift handle, located just below the seat. The chrome base and footrest complement the stool's modern design and this stool will hold up to 330 pounds. Designed for residential use, this black vinyl barstool is an excellent choice when you want a contemporary look for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919VCLlAVRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B08XJT2B8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XJT2B8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XJT2B8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
