window.products.push({"id":389414,"name":"AONBYS Travel Beach Towel, 100% Cotton Super Soft Beach Towel with Travel Bag 34\"x71\" Quick Dry,Lightweight and Sandproof Pool Towels with Lively Colo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kgP8pdU0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"⛱️DOUBLE-SIDED WOVEN& NON-FADING : Each bohemian beach towel are made with double-woven pattern and high-definition digital printing technology, The color is bright, it will not fade even if it is washed repeatedly, and it will not have any odor, it can be used many times, and it is economical and environmentally friendly. Available in 5 attractive patterns, it will make you absolutely unique on the beach. ⛱️UPGRADE 5 LAYERS OF YARN : Beach towel made of 100% genuine cotton 5 layers yarn for supreme soft and comfort for skin touch and bright in color. characteristics – quick dry, super absorbent, sand free, baby soft.Fully guarantee your warm and windproof needs after going out of the sea or swimming pool, eliminate the possibility of feeling cold or sick. Thick beach towel perfectly combines fashion and practicality. ⛱️SUPER ABSORBENT & DRIES QUICKLY : Light weight, cotton yarn provides ultimate softness, absorbency and durability and sand-free. Machine washable and long-lasting. Our beach towels absorb almost 7 times more water than other beach towels, so you can avoid the embarrassment and cold after bathing or swimming in the pool or beach, and dry quickly after use. ⛱️MULTI-PURPOSE DESIGN : Beach towel size is 34\" x 71\",suitable for both adults and children. It perfectly fits many occasions. Perfect for beaches, swimming pools, spas, saunas,hotels, yoga, travel, bathrooms,camping and picnics. can be give to your family, friends, colleagues as present. ⛱️EASY TO CARRY : The beach towels are supreme soft and can easily folded & put in it's included carrying bag,easy to carry, saving space and easy to store.Not only fit your beach towels, but also store your valuables, such as your mobile phone, wallet, ID card or keys, and enjoy a variety of conveniences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kgP8pdU0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AONBYS","source_asin":"B09YRZDBZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRZDBZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRZDBZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
