window.products.push({"id":389543,"name":"Hcooker Kitchen Heighten Circle Shelf to Increase Height for Bamboo Wood Steamer Asian Cooking Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zN2E23H7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Steaming is an important and widely used cooking technique in the Asian kitchen. Most kitchens in Asia do not have ovens, therefore baking or roasting are not commonly used cooking techniques. Instead, dumplings, breads, cakes, and other desserts are steamed. There are also wonderful soups and meat dishes and superb fish and seafood specialties that are cooked to perfection in the gentle, moist heat of a steamer. Steaming is also a perfect way to refresh stale bread and reheat leftovers. Steaming has gained popularity in the Western kitchen for its convenience, simplicity, health benefits and energy savings. Steaming envelopes the food in a hot, moist environment so it won’t dry out. And unlike boiling, natural juices, minerals and vitamins as well as color in foods are retained and not drained out in the sink. Steaming is also a very low fat way to cook because you need very little or no oils. Food should not be placed directly in the bamboo steamer without a plate (if the food is marinated, such as fish and meat) or parchment liner (if food is dry, such as buns and dumplings) and allow at least 1- inch space between the sides of the plate and the sides of the steamer.This steamer from Hcooker's Asian Kitchen line is crafted of natural bamboo.Cleaning and MaintenanceAbout the smell: natural cedar has the original fragrance of the wood, if you mind, you can put the tea in the cage and steam for a few minutes to reduce the smell.Before use: wash with water and then dry it in the vents.After use: the grease must be cleaned. The food residue must be cleaned during cleaning, otherwise it will easily lead to mold. Not often used or not used for a long time, boiled with boiling water for a while and then dried in the vent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zN2E23H7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hcooker","source_asin":"B07VLHQV99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLHQV99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLHQV99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":389544,"name":"BambooMN Custom Laser Engraved Large Wooden Oven/Pizza Peel Paddle - 21.5\"x16.5\"x0.5\" - Wood Fired Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EzqCF6kyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT: Due to the nature of natural bamboo, the outcome of each board may vary. Meaning some spots may be darker or lighter compared to others. We never know how the bamboo will take the laser engraving, but we always try our best to filter out the boards before we start engraving to ensure your satisfaction. VERSATILE DESIGNS: Get the right design to fit your particular venue - Dimensions: 21.5\" x 16.5\" x 0.5\". Hang it on the wall or side of a cupboard of your kitchen as décor. Display it in your restaurant as fun wall art. Customizable text is in red. GREAT AS A GIFT: Give away as a gift to friends or family, coworkers, your restaurant's head chef. A nice gift for birthdays, weddings, bridal showers, holidays, graduation parties, and more! SLEEK DESIGN Well rounded design with a comfortable handle size to fit most, and a hole to tie twine or a leather strap and hang it on the wall. The peel's tapered edge makes it functional and helpful for picking up food or sliding food off. MADE OF BAMBOO These wood peels are sturdy and can be a great alternative to metal peels or large plastic spatulas. Bamboo is a sustainable and renewable source of material and can be grown within an average of 3-5 years and regrown from the same root system. Most other kinds of trees take about 20 years for growth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EzqCF6kyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BambooMN","source_asin":"B07YNYR9JQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YNYR9JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YNYR9JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
