window.products.push({"id":389669,"name":"TAGREE Wedding Raffia Fans for Guest - Wedding Gift Idea for Couple & Fan Wall Decor & Boho Wall Decor (White with Straight Handle (Set of 12))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qnUohRcGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED FOR YOU - Handcrafted with care, these Handmade Raffia Hand Fans are made from natural raffia fibers, ensuring that these fans are unique in texture and appearance with a bohemian aesthetic to their designs. Whether you're using them for practical reasons or as a decorative accessory, these fans like bamboo fans are sure to add a touch of faint hint of rustic interiors. COMPLETELY FUNCTIONAL - These Handmade Raffia paddle fans are not only practical, but also stylish. The woven raffia fibers give each fan a unique texture and pattern with inter-woven symmetry, while the smooth, woven handle provides a comfortable grip. The natural look of the raffia material also makes these fans versatile enough to use as a decorative accessory for summer beach, wedding party, church, baptism party, birthday party, beach party decoration. 100% SUSTAINABLE - If you're looking for a sustainable and eco-friendly option for decor, these Handmade Raffia Hand Fans are a great choice. Raffia is a renewable resource that is harvested from the leaves of the raffia palm tree, making it a natural and sustainable material. By choosing these handcrafted fans, you're not only supporting traditional artisans, but also contributing to a more sustainable future. PERFECT DECOR ACCESSORY - Whether you're using them to keep cool, as a fashion accessory, or as a decorative element, these fans are perfect for keeping you cool on hot summer days. The Handmade Raffia Handheld Fans are sure to make a statement. Raffia fans are a no brainer when it comes to events like weddings & where you want your decor to be minimal, subtle & yet have an elegant touch to it. It is handmade with love & care, making each one a unique piece that you'll treasure for a lifetime. MEASUREMENTS AND NOTES - Dimension of each unit is 15.72” x 12” but do keep in mind that these are handmade products made from the raffia palm trees and hence might come with a minor size difference of 1-2 cm. Apart from that their light weight and portable design make them easy to carry around, that is the beauty of hand-stick or hand fans which are breezy and soothing at once. And the suave that comes just by holding palm fan or any hand fan is beyond mesmerizing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qnUohRcGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAGREE","source_asin":"B09SJ51YZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SJ51YZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SJ51YZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
