window.products.push({"id":389682,"name":"Dicuno Wood Salt Pepper Mill 5.5 inches with Ceramic Mechanism","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WQSJhS00L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Dicuno ‘Dicu K001’ 8 inches Salt & Pepper Mill is made of ceramic grinding mechanism and super  hardened steel with durable quality that can withstand daily use, it is well made and produces a consistent grind. Instruction for use: Unscrew the mill mechanism from Dicuno pepper mill, add peppercorn and select your grinding level (Coarse, medium, fine) by simply turning the grinder cap at the center of the  grinding mechanism. Turn clockwise for fine granules, and anticlockwise for coarse form. Cleaning Guide: Don’t submerge mill in water or put in the dishwasher.  (1) The inside should be clean with a small brush. If you notice clogging, put few grains of dry rice when you refill mill. These will help absorb extra moisture and the residue will be grinded through the mill along with the rice powder.  (2) Clean the outside with a soft damp cloth. Ease of use: Dicuno Pepper mill is easy to adjust, easy to fill and feel very comfortable in the hand. Design and appearance: Dicuno Grinding Pepper Mill is a classic design for your modern kitchen collection with its excellent quality for a long time use. It is an all important tool in your kitchen and banquet and a beautiful part of your kitchen or table décor and can also be use as gifts. Precaution: Don’t over –tighten the top knot when you refill the wooden mills to preserve the wood, protect luster and avoid damages to the ceramic grinding core. Warranty:1 year warranty and MONEY BACK service! Immediate Customer Services!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WQSJhS00L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DiCUNO","source_asin":"B01LXXORNE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXXORNE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXXORNE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
