window.products.push({"id":389771,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 200 PCS Non-Stick Parchment Paper for Air Fryer, 6.3\" Waterproof Oil-proof Air Fryer Paper Liners, Food Grade Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713lwTKbuBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-grade material: The parchment paper for air fryer is made of food-grade parchment paper, which not only has the characteristics of waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, and healthy but also has good heat resistance and thermal conductivity. Withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. On this basis, it will not affect the taste and texture of the food. Strong protection of the pan: Raising the edge of the air fryer disposable paper liner by 4.5 cm to protect the sides of the fryer. It will prevent food from sticking to it, thus effectively preventing food residues from staying away from the fryer, making it as clean as when not in use. Its time-saving and labor-saving will make it a favorite among bakers. Meet various needs: When making oily food, the air fryer disposable paper liners can prevent grease from dripping into the air fryer tray, saving you the hassle of cleaning. When making low-fat meals, the perforated paper pad allows for more even heating while making the most of the fryer space. Suitable for the air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc. Easy to use: Air fryer parchment paper liners come in round and bowl designs. Therefore, you don't need to remodel it. You could use it directly when cooking. ( Note: Air fryer disposable paper liners are lightweight, so always use enough food to hold down the parchment paper. When preheating the air fryer, please don't put in disposable paper liners!) No interfering with internal air circulation: The heat of the air fryer is generated by the air circulation through the walls of the pan. Using a parchment paper for air fryer will not affect its air circulation. And the grease will run off the air fryer paper liner during baking, giving you a healthier meal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713lwTKbuBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunisFun","source_asin":"B09SKWPMD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-389771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SKWPMD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SKWPMD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
